{"name":"-76-A-12","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_EV9_Intermission","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"background","value":"96","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"At an observation point some distance away from the award ceremony, several Dolls concealed in the shadows thoughtfully contemplate what has just unfolded."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Is this also part of his plan?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AK12Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AN94MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That old man would never make a move that spooks the enemy. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Not to mention the success rate is practically zero—even M16A1, who returned from that place, managed to take only one of his arms. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And even if it had truly succeeded, there would still be no way to confirm that the target himself had been present."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AK12Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK15MOD","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AK12Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK15MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...If I join in as well, we might pull it off."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AK12Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK15MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That is precisely the other problem. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She insists on fighting alone and refuses to share intelligence with us. It's almost as if she's possessed. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But perhaps this is for the best. Now, whether she likes it or not, whatever her misgivings may be, she will have to follow our plan."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AK12Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK15MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Otherwise, she can sit quietly in the audience and watch. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Judging by the obsession she has shown, that is not a path she will choose."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AK12Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AN94MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I am tracking Beluga's evacuation route. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I will establish a comms channel with her later."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AK12Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AN94MOD","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Good. Then the pieces on the board are almost assembled. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"For now... let's get the Commander back on their feet. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then, we find a way to pull the wool over that Brit's eyes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AK12Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We've got our work cut out for us... comrades."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
